From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mcla-x86 SDK patch layer
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 0320: Vulkan draws never continue inside an ownership-transfer pass

Source: $IOS tools/carbon/sdk_patches/0008-vulkan-no-draw-in-transfer-pass-pr535-ported.patch (= upstream rexglue-sdk
  PR #535, open), rebased by W0.3 (iOS-only context lines dropped); its own header kept below
Licence: BSD-3-Clause (upstream rexglue-sdk PR #535 by datamothra), ported for mcla-x86; owner's changes GPL-3
Purpose: Vulkan with dynamic rendering: the open render pass remembers the transfer destination view it was begun for,
  so a draw never continues inside an ownership-transfer pass. Matters because Renan's
  vulkan-hoist-shared-memory-uploads (default on) keeps passes open longer. Not built before G1.
Bucket: PORT

0320-vulkan-no-draw-in-transfer-pass.patch (rebase of $IOS/tools/carbon/sdk_patches/0008-vulkan-no-draw-in-transfer-pass-pr535-ported.patch,
which is upstream rexglue-sdk PR #535 "fix(vulkan): a draw never continues inside an ownership transfer pass", open, by datamothra,
BSD-3-Clause, onto ReXGlue f5337cd + Renan v0.3.17)

Purpose. With dynamic rendering (vulkan_dynamic_rendering, default true), SubmitBarriersAndEnterRenderTargetCacheRenderPass
keeps an open pass when the framebuffer matches, so a draw right after an ownership transfer into the same render target
continues inside the transfer pass (only the transfer destination attached, through the ownership-transfer view, an integer
format for 16_16 targets): invalid Vulkan. It matters more once uploads stop ending the pass (PR #536), which is what Renan's
rexglue-vulkan-hoist-shared-memory-uploads.patch does by default (vulkan_hoist_shared_memory_uploads = true).

Change. The open pass remembers the transfer destination view it was begun for (VK_NULL_HANDLE for a draw pass); each
overload reuses only a pass of its own kind. Same code as the owner's 0008 minus its iOS-only context lines
(nfsmw_inicio_pase_, PARCHE LOCAL). Vulkan only; D3D12 untouched. Not built or run (syntax check showed no new errors).

---
diff --git a/include/rex/graphics/vulkan/command_processor.h b/include/rex/graphics/vulkan/command_processor.h
index b91f6051..7285a490 100644
--- a/include/rex/graphics/vulkan/command_processor.h
+++ b/include/rex/graphics/vulkan/command_processor.h
@@ -1136,6 +1136,13 @@ class VulkanCommandProcessor : public CommandProcessor {
   // but in_render_pass_ is true.
   VkRenderPass current_render_pass_;
   const VulkanRenderTargetCache::Framebuffer* current_framebuffer_;
+  // With dynamic rendering, a transfer pass and a draw pass into the same
+  // framebuffer differ only in their attachments (the transfer binds just the
+  // destination, through an ownership transfer view whose format may be an
+  // integer one), so the framebuffer alone can't tell whether the open pass is
+  // the one needed. The transfer destination view, VK_NULL_HANDLE for a draw
+  // pass.
+  VkImageView current_transfer_dest_view_ = VK_NULL_HANDLE;
   bool in_render_pass_ = false;
 
   // Upload hoisting (CanHoistSharedMemoryUpload): whether the current render
diff --git a/src/graphics/vulkan/command_processor.cpp b/src/graphics/vulkan/command_processor.cpp
index cbced766..399b1093 100644
--- a/src/graphics/vulkan/command_processor.cpp
+++ b/src/graphics/vulkan/command_processor.cpp
@@ -3939,7 +3939,8 @@ void VulkanCommandProcessor::SubmitBarriersAndEnterRenderTargetCacheRenderPass(
 
   if (use_dynamic_rendering) {
     if (in_render_pass_ && current_framebuffer_ == framebuffer &&
-        current_render_pass_ == VK_NULL_HANDLE) {
+        current_render_pass_ == VK_NULL_HANDLE &&
+        current_transfer_dest_view_ == VK_NULL_HANDLE) {
       return;
     }
   } else {
@@ -3960,6 +3961,7 @@ void VulkanCommandProcessor::SubmitBarriersAndEnterRenderTargetCacheRenderPass(
 
   current_render_pass_ = use_dynamic_rendering ? VK_NULL_HANDLE : render_pass;
   current_framebuffer_ = framebuffer;
+  current_transfer_dest_view_ = VK_NULL_HANDLE;
 
   // Shared memory uploads for the draws in this render pass may be recorded
   // here, after the barriers before it (CanHoistSharedMemoryUpload).
@@ -4022,7 +4024,8 @@ void VulkanCommandProcessor::SubmitBarriersAndEnterRenderTargetCacheRenderPass(
 
   if (use_dynamic_rendering) {
     if (in_render_pass_ && current_framebuffer_ == framebuffer &&
-        current_render_pass_ == VK_NULL_HANDLE) {
+        current_render_pass_ == VK_NULL_HANDLE &&
+        current_transfer_dest_view_ == transfer_dest_view) {
       return;
     }
   } else {
@@ -4043,6 +4046,7 @@ void VulkanCommandProcessor::SubmitBarriersAndEnterRenderTargetCacheRenderPass(
 
   current_render_pass_ = use_dynamic_rendering ? VK_NULL_HANDLE : render_pass;
   current_framebuffer_ = framebuffer;
+  current_transfer_dest_view_ = transfer_dest_view;
 
   if (use_dynamic_rendering) {
     VkRenderingAttachmentInfo color_attachment = {};
